Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OpenReader contributors <dev@openreader.local>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ffmpeg, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, wl-clipboard, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-kde, tesseract-ocr, python3
